      "body": "I'm seeing this again on Ubuntu (x86_64, free-threaded):\r\n\r\n```\r\n======================================================================\r\nFAIL: test_map_timeout (test.test_concurrent_futures.test_process_pool.ProcessPoolSpawnProcessPoolExecutorTest.test_map_timeout)\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/buildarea/3.x.itamaro-ubuntu-aws.nogil/build/Lib/test/test_concurrent_futures/executor.py\", line 71, in test_map_timeout\r\n    self.assertEqual([None, None], results)\r\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nAssertionError: Lists differ: [None, None] != []\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://buildbot.python.org/all/#/builders/1225/builds/1670/steps/5/logs/stdio\r\n\r\nI think it's not specific to PPC64LE, but rather happens when the machine is under load and spawning processes times out too soon.",
